author: "harness:claude-code"
estimated_minutes: 60
acceptance_criteria: "The clean-build base distribution is below 20,000,000 B with the bounded-activity bundle; no product documentation leaves the package; every packaged link to an excluded page is a canonical GitHub URL marked repository-only; the docs/skills gate, the package boundary audit and the package artifact gate pass"
parent: pm-998juj
risk: low
confidence: high
resolution: "docs/TESTING.md keeps its product linked-test half. The 16 sections about this repository's own checks moved verbatim to the repository-only docs/REPOSITORY_TESTING.md. package.json excludes docs/performance/**, REPOSITORY_TESTING.md, QUALITY_EVIDENCE.md and MCP_2026_07_28_CONFORMANCE.md. Packaged pages link them by canonical GitHub URL marked repository-only, docs-reachability-exceptions.json records each reason, and docs/README.md indexes HISTORY_RECOVERY.md."
expected_result: "The clean-build base distribution is below 20,000,000 B with the bounded-activity bundle, and no product documentation leaves the package"
actual_result: "Clean rebuild: base distribution 19,994,182 of 20,000,000 B (5.8 KB headroom; it was 20,044,200 B in CI before the tranche); the docs/skills gate, the package boundary audit and the package artifact gate pass"
